# Content

- Notes are MDX in `content/docs`, ordered by `content/docs/meta.json`, loaded in `src/lib/source.ts`.
- A new document-shaped section (projects, writing) is a new Fumadocs collection, then a route. Not a hardcoded array in a component.
- Name, bio, locale, direction, and profile links stay in `src/lib/site.ts`.
- Fumadocs APIs: https://fumadocs.dev/llms.txt

Guide: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)
